    "title": "Ronald McDonald House Charities to host annual telethon - NewsBreak",
    "text": "The Ronald McDonald House Charities of Eastern North Carolina, 529 Moye Blvd., will host its ninth Annual Telethon in partnership with WNCT-TV from 6 a.m. to 7 p.m. on Friday. During the event, viewers will have the opportunity to hear stories from families and volunteers while being invited to give back to the mission of keeping families close. Throughout the day, live broadcasts will showcase family stories, volunteer testimonies and ways viewers can make a difference, all while raising essential funds to help provide the comforts of home for families while their children receive care. To donate, call 888-558-1878, text TELETHON9 to 44321 or visit rmhcenc.org/donate. Subscribe to The Daily Reflector",
